{ "The power-law distribution of fluxes is consistent with previous simulations and theoretical approaches in complex networks.": "consistent with previous simulations" },
{ "The threshold in flux correlations indicates that fast-flux reactions in linear and circular pathways are highly sensitive to knockouts.": "fast-flux reactions" },
